# .dockerignore del repo (raíz).
# Aplicado a todos los docker build del proyecto.
# Reduce el context enviado al Docker daemon, lo que baja
# tiempos de build y previene leaks de secretos.

# --- Git ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Node / Frontend ---
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
**/.astro
**/.next
**/.nuxt
**/.cache
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/.eslintcache

# --- PHP / Composer / Laravel ---
**/vendor
**/composer.phar
backend/.phpunit.cache
backend/.phpunit.result.cache
backend/storage/logs/*
backend/storage/framework/cache/*
backend/storage/framework/sessions/*
backend/storage/framework/views/*
backend/bootstrap/cache/*.php
!backend/bootstrap/cache/.gitkeep
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
!backend/.env.example

# --- IDEs / Editor / OS ---
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.bak

# --- Documentación / Meta ---
README.md
LICENSE
LICENSE.*
CONTRIBUTING.md
docs/
.claude/
.opencode/

# --- Docker / CI ---
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml
Caddyfile

# --- Archivos de AI / Memoria ---
.mcp_config*
.claude/
.opencode/
.cursor/
.aider*
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.local.md

# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/
**/logs

# --- Tests / Coverage ---
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/playwright/.cache
**/.nyc_output
